WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.903
US INTELLIGENCE EXPERTS SAY FIGHTING IN UKRAINE IS
EXPECTED TO SLOW IN THE NEXT FEW

00:00:03.903 --> 00:00:09.275
MONTHS BUT NOT END, OF COURSE.
UKRAINIANS ARE STILL BRACING FOR

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:13.146
NEW ATTACKS ON THE ENERGY GRID
AS TEMPERATURES DROP.

00:00:13.146 --> 00:00:19.219
RUSSIAN TROOPS ARE FOCUSSED ON
THE EASTERN DONETSK REGION.

00:00:19.219 --> 00:00:24.223
WILL RIP LILEY JOINS US FROM A B
SHELTER IN KYIV, UKRAINE.

00:00:24.223 --> 00:00:26.759
I UNDERSTAND YOU HAD TO GO TO
SAFETY THIS MORNING?

00:00:26.759 --> 00:00:29.195
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YEAH.
THAT'S NOT NECESSARILY THE

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:32.665
ASSESSMENT HERE IN UKRAINE.
AND CERTAINLY WHAT WE ARE

00:00:32.665 --> 00:00:35.435
EXPE
EXPERIENCING RIGHT NOW WE DON'T

00:00:35.435 --> 00:00:38.071
KNOW WHAT IS HAPPENING.
LET ME LAY OUT WHAT'S BEEN

00:00:38.071 --> 00:00:39.639
HAPPENING.
WE HAVE A LIVE POSITION TOWARDS

00:00:39.639 --> 00:00:41.808
THE TOP FLOOR OF THIS HOTEL
LOOKING OUTSIDE.

00:00:41.808 --> 00:00:47.981
WE HEARD THE AIR-RAID SIRENS GO
OFF, FOLLOWED BY REPORTS OF

00:00:47.981 --> 00:00:50.950
POTENTIAL INCOMING RUSSIAN
MISSILES, A LARGE AMOUNT, DOZENS

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:54.854
OF MISSILES INCOMING HEADED IN
THIS DIRECTION.

00:00:54.854 --> 00:00:58.825
SO WE AND ALL OF OUR STAFF HAVE
MOVED DOWN TO THE BOMB SHELTERS

00:00:58.825 --> 00:01:01.895
UNDER GROUND.
ADJACENT TO AN UNDERGROUND

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.165
PARKING LOT.
SO THEY CONVERTED THIS AREA BUT

00:01:05.165 --> 00:01:10.069
IT'S REINFORCED WITH CONCRETE,
SAFE TO BROADCAST FROM HERE AND

00:01:10.069 --> 00:01:13.139
NOW WE WAIT FOR INFORMATION OF
WHAT MAY BE HAPPENING.

00:01:13.139 --> 00:01:17.210
THE LAST ATTACK THAT HAPPENED 12
DAYS AGO, RUSSIA LAUNCHED MORE

00:01:17.210 --> 00:01:20.947
THAN 70 MISSILES AND THE
UKRAINIANS SHOT DOWN MORE THAN

00:01:20.947 --> 00:01:22.815
50 OF THEM.
A HIGH SUCCESS RATE.

00:01:22.815 --> 00:01:25.985
BUT STILL AROUND 20 OF THOSE
MISSILES HIT THEIR TARGETS AND

00:01:25.985 --> 00:01:29.656
THOSE TARGETS UNFORTUNATELY THE
CIVILIAN POWER INFRASTRUCTURE

00:01:29.656 --> 00:01:32.492
THEY'VE BEEN REBUILDING TRYING
TO GET THE LIGHTS AND HEAT BACK

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:37.163
ON FOR PEOPLE ACROSS UKRAINE IF
WE ARE ON THE FRONT END OF

00:01:37.163 --> 00:01:40.366
ANOTHER ATTACK OR THE ATTACK
COMES LATER IT'S BAD NEWS FOR

00:01:40.366 --> 00:01:45.138
FAMILIES STRUGGLING WITH
TEMPERATURES PLUNGING HERE.

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:50.243
IN UKRAINE, WINTER IS COMING.
IN THE CAPITAL, KYIV, THE

00:01:50.243 --> 00:01:52.345
FOREIGN MINISTER WARNS SNOW
WON'T BE THE ONLY THING FALLING

00:01:52.345 --> 00:01:58.418
FROM THE SKIES.
&gt;&gt; WE ARE ANTICIPATING ANOTHER

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.186
MASSIVE MISSILE ATTACK BY
RUSSIA.

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:03.022
AND THE GOAL OF THIS ATTACK IS
TO BRING TOTAL DESTRUCTION TO

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:08.261
OUR ENERGY SYSTEM.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: CREWS ARE RACING TO

00:02:08.261 --> 00:02:12.632
RESTORE POWER.
THESE TENTS SET UP BY THE

00:02:12.632 --> 00:02:16.436
GOVERNMENT, A BADLY NEEDED BREAK
FROM THE BITTER COLD.

00:02:16.436 --> 00:02:21.974
AT THIS FAST FOOD PLACE, BRAVING
BELOW ZERO TEMPERATURES AT THE

00:02:21.974 --> 00:02:26.445
OUTDOOR GRILL KEEPS THE DOORS
OPEN WHEN THE LIGHTS ARE OFF.

00:02:26.445 --> 00:02:29.582
SOME CUSTOMERS SAID THEY ONLY
WANT TO COME WHEN THERE'S NO

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:32.352
POWER BECAUSE THE FOOD TASTES SO
MUCH BETTER.

00:02:32.352 --> 00:02:37.223
WE'RE JUST UKRAINIANS SHE SAID,
THAT'S OUR SECRET INGREDIENT.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:44.030
ANOTHER SECRET FOR SURVIVING
DARK TIMES, CANDLES, A GOOD CRY,

00:02:44.030 --> 00:02:45.965
AND PRAYER.
&gt;&gt; WHEN YOU COME HERE, WHAT DO

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:49.869
YOU PRAY FOR?
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WE PRAY FOR PEACE,

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:53.740
FOR THE WAR TO BE OVER SHE SAID.
DESCRIBING THE HARDSHIP OF LIFE

00:02:53.740 --> 00:02:56.743
WITHOUT ELECTRICITY.
THEN I COME HERE AND REMEMBER

00:02:56.743 --> 00:03:01.114
HOW MUCH TIME WE SPENT HIDING IN
BASEMENTS.

00:03:01.114 --> 00:03:08.254
HIDING FROM RUSSIAN SOLDIERS WHO
OCCUPY AND TERRORIZED THEIR

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:11.924
DOWN.
BUCHA, THE SITE OF WHAT UKRAINE

00:03:11.924 --> 00:03:15.061
CALLS UNSPEAKABLE WAR CRIMES.
&gt;&gt; IF YOU DIDN'T KNOW WHAT

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:32.879
HAPPENED HERE, THIS COULD BE ANY
CHURCH IN ANY QUIET KYIV SUBURB.

00:03:32.879 --> 00:03:33.980
UNTIL YOU LOOK AND SEE THE
BULLET HOLES.

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:37.183
&gt;&gt; A CLUSTER BOMB.
&gt;&gt; BULLET HOLES IN HER

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:40.386
CHILDREN'S BEDROOM WINDOWS.
AFTER LIVING THROUGH THE RUSSIAN

00:03:40.386 --> 00:03:43.656
OCCUPATION, SHE CAN HANDLE
LIVING WITHOUT POWER.

00:03:43.656 --> 00:03:47.660
&gt;&gt; WHAT IS REAL PROBLEM IS OR IS
NOT ELECTRICITY.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:51.331
WE DON'T HAVE ANY CONNECTION.
SO I HAVE KIDS, IF SOMETHING

00:03:51.331 --> 00:03:55.001
WRONG I CANNOT CALL TO THE
HOSPITAL AND CALL EMERGENCY.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:58.471
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SHE TELLS ME WHEN
THE POWER GOES OUT, SHE LOSES

00:03:58.471 --> 00:04:01.107
CELL PHONE SERVICE AND INTERNET.
BUT THEN --

00:04:01.107 --> 00:04:06.145
&gt;&gt; OH MY GOD, IT'S MIRACLE.
&gt;&gt; IS THAT THE LIGHTS COMING ON

00:04:06.145 --> 00:04:07.246
NOW?
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:04:07.246 --> 00:04:09.515
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE FIRST PLACE SHE
GOES, THE KITCHEN.

00:04:09.515 --> 00:04:11.351
&gt;&gt; COFFEE, THAT'S YOUR NUMBER
ONE PRIORITY?

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:15.054
&gt;&gt; MY NUMBER ONE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: SHE'S GRATEFUL FOR

00:04:15.054 --> 00:04:18.591
THE LITTLE THINGS IN LIFE.
&gt;&gt; IT'S A MOMENT OF HAPPINESS.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:26.198
&gt;&gt; GRATEFUL JUST TO BE ALIVE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: YOU CAN UNDERSTAND

00:04:26.198 --> 00:04:30.002
THE SENTIMENT WHEN PEOPLE ARE
LIVING FOR THE LAST NINE MONTHS

00:04:30.002 --> 00:04:35.208
UNDER THE CONSTANT THREAT OF
RUSSIAN MISSILES RAINING DOWN ON

00:04:35.208 --> 00:04:39.078
THEIR HOMES.
THE AIR-RAID SIRENS GO OFF SO

00:04:39.078 --> 00:04:43.649
MUCH THEY'RE IMMUNE TO IT BUT
THIS TIME, THE REPORTS, A LOT OF

00:04:43.649 --> 00:04:46.352
PEOPLE IN UKRAINE HIDING IN
THEIR BASEMENTS WONDERING IF THE

00:04:46.352 --> 00:04:50.556
LIGHTS ARE GOING TO BE KNOCKED
OUT AND WHEN THEY'LL BE ABLE TO

00:04:50.556 --> 00:04:54.927
DO THINGS THAT WE TAKE FOR
GRANTED LIKE HAVING A HOT CUP OF

00:04:54.927 --> 00:04:56.262
COFFEE AT THEIR HOUSE. 

